## 0.3.0 · [d4ed612](https://github.com/volmodaoist/Obsidian-Mindmap-Studio/tree/d4ed6122f29c5ea43fb771e0a96cebde9b7e8dbb) → [ef5a566](https://github.com/volmodaoist/Obsidian-Mindmap-Studio/tree/ef5a566632c65e158fc4ec88e699972ffe4e3cdc)

